# The endpoint image needs ONLY the Primus package. Exclude everything else
# from the Docker build context — including the untracked Xcode folder, the
# monolith, UMA, and all engine material not needed to serve certify/collapse.
*
!Primus/
# ...and trim noise from within Primus/ itself.
Primus/outputs/
Primus/__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
Primus/.pytest_cache/
